# @hub-lanes

# ── ARCHIE SELF-IMPROVEMENT LOOP (BH-4587) ──────────────────────────────────
# Hourly at :43, clear of the watch (:07/:27/:47) and the queue doctor. A tick
# reads the archie_actions rows of the last window_days + verify_days + 1 days,
# fingerprints each by cause, and files ONE ai-build issue on the harness repo
# for a cause that recurred archie.improve.recur_n times in the window. It
# comments new occurrences on the open issue, tracks the closed issue to its
# merged PR, reopens it with evidence on a recurrence, and records it verified
# after archie.improve.verify_days of silence. Every GitHub write is an
# archie_actions row claimed first; flock -n dedupes. It never writes the fix.
# Off: ARCHIE_FMI_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-archie-fm-improve,
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off archie-fm-improve, or the settings row archie.manage=off.
43 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/archie-fm-improve.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
